  "privacyScreenGoSync": "Sync: what connects to the server",
  "privacyScreenGoAccount": "Account: logging in and out",
  "privacyScreenGitHubText": "A public copy of the song database (when no server answers) and checking whether there’s a new version of the app. Once a day, when the app opens. Themes: the list and files only in Appearance › Download a theme, and once for a theme chosen before it became a downloadable one.",
